      "displayText": "번개에 맞은 듯한 충격이었어!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n전기구슬을 지니게 한 피카츄보다\n강한 피카츄가 있다니... 말도 안 돼!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕũ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC88AC1CC5D00020B9DEC7400020B4EFD55C0020CDA9ACA9C774C5C8C5B4002100100001BE01000AC804AE30AD6CC2ACC7440020C9C0B2C8AC8C0020D55C0020D53CCE74CE04BCF4B2E4000AAC15D55C0020D53CCE74CE04AC000020C788B2E4B2C8002E002E002E0020B9D0B3C40020C5480020B3FC002100100002011401690000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "너희의 힘을 인정하는 뜻으로\n전기구슬을 선물할게!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕũ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1132,
