      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "부담 갖지 않아도 돼!\n난 전기구슬 컬렉터거든!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕũ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BD80B2F40020AC16C9C00020C54AC544B3C40020B3FC0021000AB09C0020C804AE30AD6CC2AC0020CEECB809D130AC70B4E0002100100002011401690000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "피카츄, 걱정 마!\n앞으로 더 강해지면 되니까!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕũ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D53CCE74CE04002C0020AC71C8150020B9C80021000AC55EC73CB85C0020B3540020AC15D574C9C0BA740020B418B2C8AE4C002100100002011401690000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "전기구슬을 지닌 레벨 100 피카츄가 되면\n진정한 세계 최강이 될 수 있을 거야!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕũ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
